		{"id":"74baf64f2f68fad4","type":"text","text":"Notes","x":26,"y":-2226,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c2a8a5e2b5617838","type":"text","text":"Dead","x":773,"y":-2077,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"794e4b2a4a89dacf","type":"text","text":"Infernal Magic == Illegal","x":581,"y":-2677,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"34c3e312a6a29ff6","type":"text","text":"Magister Devan used Infernal magic in an attempt to make the HellForge Centurions \n\nHad a contract with the IceDevil to help him research to contrust the HellForge Centurions \n\nFailed to uphold his end of the contract with an IceDevil and got killed because of it","x":453,"y":-2486,"width":405,"height":240,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"bf1682878ff1fca4","type":"text","text":"Magister in Jiothal","x":398,"y":-2076,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"231fb55bfad1df44","type":"text","text":"The Kenku came to Sylvia offering her another job in exchange for information on Arlina Korrin as well as fifty thousand gold pieces.\n\nThe Kenku is in service to Lord Renthial Shardcaller\n\nThe kenku informant came to deliver Kalyths letter personally to Sir Renthiel Shardcaller - Later in the day the Kenku came to relay a message from Renthiel Shardcaller - \"Dear Kalyth, you are to be gladly accepted amongst my Gala. Not only this, but I welcome you to please bring along any of your travelling compatriots- so long of course as they arrive in fashion. It shall be a wonderful time I am sure, and remember that the Gala is to happen within two days. Do _try_ not to be late.\"\n\nThe Kenku was secretly Conirutato, Demon Lord of Conspiracy who created Raven Rot","x":443,"y":-1712,"width":540,"height":341,"color":"#490070"},
		{"id":"26d4037bd22633b4","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Kenku Informant.png","x":-138,"y":-1971,"width":246,"height":400,"color":"#490070"},
		{"id":"050c2d9e70174bf6","type":"text","text":"Magister Devan\n","x":26,"y":-2076,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"bbbd37fdc24087ae","type":"text","text":"[[Raven Rot]]","x":193,"y":-1906,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#490070"},
		{"id":"3e0c5d902ee72406","type":"text","text":"Notes","x":193,"y":-1801,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#490070"},
		{"id":"0cb06a3fe5860b43","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Renthiel Shardcaller.png","x":251,"y":-500,"width":255,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bc974df1585e15c6","type":"text","text":"Everbloom is the main person interested in learning more about the Ran'tal","x":-314,"y":-390,"width":520,"height":200,"color":"#1e389f"},
		{"id":"615a5f8445154cf6","type":"text","text":"Churral'ken","x":1760,"y":-564,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"de110da4e116d3ab","type":"text","text":"Notes","x":1235,"y":393,"width":250,"height":50,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"18caa6ac03933e8b","type":"text","text":"Churral'ken was found within the Primal Ruins. He was summoned  by using the Ran'tal summoning circles as well as the spell that was written on a tablet.\n\nChurral'ken is a Obsoleth and it follows the God of the void Alqu'vor - [[List of Gods]]","x":2040,"y":-429,"width":425,"height":215},
		{"id":"af3ea81d7ec34245","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Churral'ken.png","x":1165,"y":-640,"width":400,"height":211},
		{"id":"8efebd06bf085c7e","type":"text","text":"Renthiel Shardcaller","x":574,"y":-274,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"4fbdc09f0329f28f","type":"text","text":"Liberian in Astelrath","x":-550,"y":-150,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#1e389f"},
		{"id":"8f0c5b5c981d39a8","type":"text","text":"Mistiria Everbloom","x":-550,"y":0,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#1e389f"},
		{"id":"5935114c72760763","type":"text","text":"The Inquisitor can tell if you are lying to them through a serious training regime.\n\nShe accompanied us within the [[Underdark Ruins]] due to Invari asking them to join the Expedition into the ruin.","x":233,"y":-45,"width":547,"height":180},
		{"id":"46152f06c0595d89","type":"text","text":"Hosting the Gala for a formal get together - Within Ethee\n\nHis family is racist","x":1004,"y":-162,"width":395,"height":88,"color":"5"},
